#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Per-industry content for the industry landing pages.

The variable across these nine is WHICH WORKFLOWS DOMINATE, not the noun.
High-consideration categories phone BEFORE buying (sizing, fitment, quote);
low-consideration categories phone AFTER (WISMO, returns, back-in-stock). That
is what keeps nine pages from being one page, and it keeps every page consistent
with our own published argument that nobody phones before buying a t-shirt.

Rule for the questions table: if a row could be copied to another industry
unchanged, it does not belong on the page. Each row names the actual field the
answer resolves against.

`proof` renders only where it is true. No invented logos, no illustrative
customer names.
"""

