    ("Can it change or cancel a subscription on the call?","Yes, where your subscription platform allows writes - skip, pause, change date, change address. That is the highest-volume request in this category and the one most often handled by hand today."),
    ("What about returns on opened consumables?","It checks your actual policy, which in this category is usually narrower than elsewhere. The important part is that the phone answer and the portal answer are the same one."),
